### 1. Rejestracja nowego konta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Anna", "email": "anna@test.pl", "password": "haslo1234" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 1b. Logowanie
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "anna2@test.pl", "password": "haslo1234" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Moje portfele (po rejestracji: jeden "Mój portfel", role OWNER)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Nowy portfel, oczekiwane 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mieszkanie" }

> {% client.global.set("walletId", response.body.id); %}

### 4. Jeden portfel
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Zmiana nazwy
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mieszkanie Krakowska 12" }

### 6. Pusta nazwa, oczekiwane 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "" }

### 7. Usunięcie, oczekiwane 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Ten sam portfel po usunięciu, oczekiwane 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Bez tokena, oczekiwane 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets